role: event

= The end of ​PxC

The far-right, xenophobic party of PxC has officially been dissolved. After time and time again failing to get any meaningful representation, the party direction has merged into VOX, though not all in the party have followed that path. Some have gone their separate way and formed the FNC. 

With only a negligible presence in a very reduced number of local councils, the new far-right pro-independence party is at the very extreme fringes of the mainstream, and is considered almost a meme party by some. The name is quite unfortunate though, as a historical progressist antifascist organization of the same name has already condemned the party and denied any ties. 

- @post_event: Let's hope they stay as irrelevant as they have been so far.
